      "claim": "If the panel treats the message limb as unestablished rather than met, POL-GEN-26 governs and still does not give the rider the money. 'Whether the driver messaged and called before cancelling' is one of the facts POL-GEN-26 names by name, and the remedy it prescribes is escalation with the amount held rather than returned. ESCALATE is therefore the correct floor for the driver on this record: the 5.00 SGD stays held pending human review instead of being confirmed back to the rider.",
